ncies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6 beta2\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you click a node that uses transient dock (e.g. TileMapLayer) and the dock appears on side, once the dock closes the previous tab is not restored.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78a82a36-771e-42bc-819d-9d13b5ebefae\n\nI'd expect Inspector (previous tab) to be reopened, but instead it opens Groups (last tab).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n0. Use default layout\n1. Add TileMapLayer\n2. Move TileMap dock from bottom to the side\n3. Deselect TileMapLayer\n4. Select Inspector tab\n5. Select TileMapLayer again\n6. Deselect it again\n7. See current tab\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1